From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WTF: run on the libSystem of iOS 6 and on armv7

Threading, clocks, logging and dispatch where a 2012 libSystem and a current
WTF disagree: work queues dispatch a leaked function through the plain
dispatch_*_f calls this release has, the NEON paths are usable again on this
CPU, and the soft-linking assert names the missing symbol and its framework
instead of printing an empty dlerror(), which is what made missing-constant
crashes diagnosable.
